<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 459.63 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 459.63 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought 459.63 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 68.81 million rands worth on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
